<title>FRANCE: Block of 7.2 pct traded in Strafor-Facom.</title>
<headline>Block of 7.2 pct traded in Strafor-Facom.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of some 7.2 percent in office furniture and equipment company Strafor-Facom was traded on the market on Wednesday mroning, dealers said.</p>
<p>The block of 636,000 shares was traded at 404.7 francs. At Strafor-Facom there was no immediate comment. At 1136 GMT, Strafor shares were down 0.99 percent at 400 francs. -- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
